<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12144" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπισχῡρ-ίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>oppose firmly, give a flat denial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.140
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰς ἡδονάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Agis</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			,al.; <i>hold out against,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς δίψος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.149c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>set oneself to affirm, maintain</i> a thing, ib.<i><span class="en">
				28.342c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1278.53
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>cling firmly,</i> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπάς,</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1096
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
